'''G1 Climax 2026 Day 2''' was the second show of the [[G1 Climax 2026]] tournament produced by [[New Okaiken Pro-Wrestling|NOPW]], held on September 7, 2026 at the Okami Municipal Gymnasium in [[Okami]]. The show featured all five [[G1 Climax 2026|Block B]] Round 1 matches — the block's opening night, headlined by the tournament debuts of [[KAZUKI (wrestler)|KAZUKI]] as the block favourite and [[Jusuf Muntasir]] as its most unsettling presence.

The night is remembered for Jusuf's 8-minute destruction of [[Tadayoshi Ishida]] — the fastest win of the tournament so far, and a warning to every wrestler in Block B — and for the match of the night between [[Takagi Yuto]] and [[Daigo Kuroki]], two strong-style standouts who pushed each other to the limit.

